{
  "$comment": "Every method the agent page sends over the pane transport, with the top-level params and _meta.acpmux keys the app relay takes for it (AcpmuxPaneMethods+Params.swift knownParams, which refuses any other key as transport.intent_invalid, and AcpmuxPaneMethods.requests, which refuses any other method). webviews/test/agent-pane-method-contracts.test.ts reads every send in webviews/src/agent-session/acpmux with the TypeScript checker and fails, naming the method, when one has no entry here, or when its params name a key the entry lacks; AcpmuxPaneMethodContractsTests holds knownParams and requests equal to `methods`, and the webviews test holds cmux-agent-pane-policy policy.json to it. `frames`: a file of whole frames for a method whose params a helper builds (its own tests hold the page and the relay to it). `not_relayed`: methods the page sends only where no app relay sits (a browser device, mock mode, gitRoute daemon) or through the native bridge (postNative), never over the pane socket in the app. `refused_today`: methods the page sends over the pane socket in the app that the relay refuses as transport.method_refused; each is a live bug of this class, listed so it stays visible until the relay takes it or the page stops sending it. RFD 0028 (failure classes); cmux#46563 sent initialize _meta.acpmux.peerRowBatches with no rule and every chat reconnected about 490 times an hour (cmux#49148, ask-0e0d5a479b).",
  "not_relayed": {
    "_acpmux/browser_workspaces": "Sent only with host.browserDevice (direct.ts), a browser talking to acpmux, not the app relay.",
    "cloud.repo.add": "postNative (session-info/CloudRepositoryPicker.tsx): the native bridge.",
